#
# Declarative structural assertions for the guides slice.
# The guides slice has no migratable rdflib pytest; these cells are authored
# fresh to pin its keystone invariants and the referential integrity of its
# dogfooded recipes/learning-paths (MAXIMAL coverage, dogfooding). Each runs as
# a SPARQL ASK over the module graph (gmeow:scopeModule). The slice dogfoods the
# curated pedagogy formerly hardcoded in the docs tooling: gmeow:Recipe and
# gmeow:LearningPath individuals (Principle 4 — authored once).

@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix ex:    <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/guides/tests/> .

# --- 1. Recipe / LearningPath are QualityValues (MUST hold) -------------------
ex:saGuideKindsAreQualityValues a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/>
ASK {
    gmeow:Recipe       a owl:Class , logic:AbstractIndividualType ; rdfs:subClassOf logic:QualityValue .
    gmeow:LearningPath a owl:Class , logic:AbstractIndividualType ; rdfs:subClassOf logic:QualityValue .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:Recipe and gmeow:LearningPath MUST each be a logic:AbstractIndividualType owl:Class subClassOf logic:QualityValue — curated pedagogy authored as value-vocabulary individuals, not domain-axiom classes." .

# --- 2. includesRecipe relates LearningPath to Recipe (MUST hold) -------------
ex:saIncludesRecipeShape a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:must ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
ASK {
    gmeow:includesRecipe a owl:ObjectProperty ;
        rdfs:domain gmeow:LearningPath ; rdfs:range gmeow:Recipe .
    gmeow:learningAudience a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain gmeow:LearningPath .
    gmeow:followsGuidePath a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain gmeow:Recipe .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:includesRecipe MUST link gmeow:LearningPath to gmeow:Recipe (a path folds in recipes as stations); gmeow:learningAudience is a LearningPath datatype property and gmeow:followsGuidePath a Recipe datatype property — the asymmetric shape distinguishing the two guide kinds." .

# --- 3. Every Recipe is well-formed: slug + title + goal (MUST-NOT hold) ------
ex:saEveryRecipeWellFormed a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:mustNot ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
ASK {
    ?r a gmeow:Recipe .
    FILTER (
        NOT EXISTS { ?r gmeow:guideSlug  ?s } ||
        NOT EXISTS { ?r gmeow:guideTitle ?t } ||
        NOT EXISTS { ?r gmeow:guideGoal  ?g }
    )
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "Every dogfooded gmeow:Recipe MUST carry a gmeow:guideSlug (stable key), a gmeow:guideTitle (docs headline), and a gmeow:guideGoal (modelling outcome): the slice MUST NOT contain a malformed recipe missing any of the three. Guards the authored-once docs surface the renderer projects." .

# --- 4. Every LearningPath has an audience + a goal (MUST-NOT hold) -----------
ex:saEveryLearningPathWellFormed a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:mustNot ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
ASK {
    ?p a gmeow:LearningPath .
    FILTER (
        NOT EXISTS { ?p gmeow:learningAudience ?a } ||
        NOT EXISTS { ?p gmeow:guideGoal         ?g }
    )
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "Every dogfooded gmeow:LearningPath MUST name its gmeow:learningAudience and its gmeow:guideGoal: the slice MUST NOT contain a path missing either, so each curated journey states who it is for and what it achieves." .

# --- 5. includesRecipe targets are typed Recipes (MUST-NOT hold) --------------
ex:saIncludedRecipesAreRecipes a gmeow:StructuralAssertion ;
    gmeow:saPolarity gmeow:mustNot ;
    gmeow:saScope gmeow:scopeModule ;
    gmeow:saPattern """PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>
ASK {
    ?p gmeow:includesRecipe ?r .
    FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?r a gmeow:Recipe }
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "Referential integrity of the dogfooded catalog: every target of gmeow:includesRecipe MUST be a typed gmeow:Recipe — the slice MUST NOT include a dangling or mistyped recipe reference, so a learning path's stations always resolve to real recipes." .
